stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discarded : feed item with a known URL hash, or the same title hash within 48 h (BR-48)
    Discarded --> [*]
    [*] --> PENDING : new item stored with its coin tags (UC-52, NSF-10)
    PENDING --> SUMMARIZED : AI summary and sentiment stored (NSF-11)
    PENDING --> FAILED : no summary after 3 attempts (D-128)
    FAILED --> PENDING : Admin asks for a new summary
    PENDING --> HIDDEN : Admin hides the article
    SUMMARIZED --> HIDDEN : Admin hides the article
    FAILED --> HIDDEN : Admin hides the article
    HIDDEN --> PENDING : Admin restores, no summary yet
    HIDDEN --> SUMMARIZED : Admin restores, summary kept
